		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A 30-foot-long vine with one crimson bloom. When warm- blooded creatures approach, it rears up, releases pollen, and attacks. Mindless plant.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16, <strong>HP</strong> 48, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 tentacles (near) +7 (1d8 + grab) and spore cloud, <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -4, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Grab</strong>. STR 15+ or held. STR 15+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p><p><strong>Spore Cloud</strong>. Enemies within double near CHA 15+ or dazed and drawn to viper vine for 1d4 rounds. Immune for 1 day if passed check.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
